@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox

title SSD: US017 - Create a private list of my publications

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System : I want to create a new private list of my publications
activate System

System --> User : Please provide the list name and select a genre

User -> System : List name and genre information

System --> User : The private list has been successfully created

deactivate System
deactivate User

@enduml
